library "Semnot Age 232".

// Mirrors the IEHP #232 real artifact: an under-21 gate = sem-not over the
// patient-age both-representation (recency) concept — the local `code is` override
// recency-merged with a Patient age `source representation` (#257, replacing the
// retired `definition is age today` carve-out).
concept "Age 21 Or Older":
- value type is boolean.
- code is `age-21-or-older`.
- source representation:
  - type is Patient.
  - value projection is age today at least 21 years.

concept "Under Age 21":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- defined as ( sem-not "Age 21 Or Older" ).

decision "Eligibility":
first:
- when "Under Age 21" then recommend activity "certify.Approve".
- otherwise then recommend activity "not-certify.Deny".

activity "certify.Approve":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Eligibility: APPROVE / under 21.`.
activity "not-certify.Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Eligibility: DENY / 21 or older.`.
